# lowered from the probe json.json by the fixture lowering (private tooling)
# The lane runs `ds-formal-tests --fixture` on this and diffs against
# json.expected (scripts/formal/check_idris.py). The JSON leaf rung's smoke
# pair: one Payload fact whose Json slot holds the document
# the `json 11` record spells, and one rule per reading. An unresolved path
# reads as null (rule 0, [LNUL.8.4]); has() tells the two missings apart
# while the present null reads as null (1, [LEXP.6.1]); leaves keep their
# kinds, an Int, a String, a Bool under `is true`, a Float under an ordering
# (2, [LEXP.7.12.1]); a nested member, a bracket index and len() of the
# array (3, [LGRA.5.8.1], [LEXP.6.2]); len() of an object traps and rule 4
# never fires ([LEXP.6.2]); a String leaf ordered traps and rule 5 never
# fires ([LEXP.7.12.1]); `??` rescues the present null and keeps the present
# value (6); a segment into a leaf and a key into an array leave the path
# unresolved (7, the model's reading of [LNUL.8.4]); the float zero has no
# sign (8, [LGRA.5.8.8]); the whole document copied into Out is coded by the
# same token (9, [LFAC.2.5.1]). The string table: 0 missing, 1 nulled, 2 n,
# 3 s, 4 x, 5 b, 6 f, 7 o, 8 k, 9 arr, 10 z, and 11 the document, keyed
# apart from every String; the key id 1 is the block 18, the document's
# token the block 91. 1.0 is its bits 4607182418800017408, 2.5 is
# 4612811918334230528, and the folded zero is 0.
schema 0 entity Payload
schema 1 entity Out
alpha 0 0
alpha 1 1
rule 0 absent_reads_null
pattern 0 0 0
where 0 0 is null path 1 k:0 slot 0 pay 0
log 0 0 0
rule 1 has_separates_the_missings
pattern 1 0 0
where 1 0 and and has 1 k:1 slot 0 pay 0 not has 1 k:0 slot 0 pay 0 is null path 1 k:1 slot 0 pay 0
log 1 0 0
rule 2 leaves_keep_their_kinds
pattern 2 0 0
where 2 0 and and and eq path 1 k:2 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:3 eq path 1 k:3 slot 0 pay 0 lit s:4 is true path 1 k:5 slot 0 pay 0 gt path 1 k:6 slot 0 pay 0 lit f:4607182418800017408
log 2 0 0
rule 3 nested_and_indexed
pattern 3 0 0
where 3 0 and and eq path 2 k:7 k:8 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:1 eq path 2 k:9 i:1 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:2 eq len path 1 k:9 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:2
log 3 0 0
rule 4 len_of_an_object_is_a_type_error
pattern 4 0 0
where 4 0 eq len path 1 k:7 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:1
log 4 0 0
rule 5 a_string_leaf_ordered_is_a_type_error
pattern 5 0 0
where 5 0 gt path 1 k:3 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:5
log 5 0 0
rule 6 coalesce_reads_the_null_leaf
pattern 6 0 0
where 6 0 and eq coalesce path 1 k:1 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:7 lit i:7 eq coalesce path 1 k:2 slot 0 pay 0 lit i:7 lit i:3
log 6 0 0
rule 7 a_segment_into_a_leaf_is_absent
pattern 7 0 0
where 7 0 and is null path 2 k:2 k:4 slot 0 pay 0 not has 2 k:9 k:8 slot 0 pay 0
log 7 0 0
rule 8 a_zero_has_no_sign
pattern 8 0 0
where 8 0 gt div lit f:4607182418800017408 path 1 k:10 slot 0 pay 0 lit f:0
log 8 0 0
rule 9 copies_the_document
pattern 9 0 0
emitx 9 1 1 1 slot 0 key 0 slot 0 pay 0
json 11 obj 8 9 arr 2 i:1 i:2 5 b:1 6 f:4612811918334230528 2 i:3 1 null 7 obj 1 8 i:1 3 s:4 10 f:0
step assert _0 0 1000000000000000000018 1000000000000000000091
step pump
